
! ---- Core Swadesh vocabulary (cross-checked against the ASJP wordlist, 
!      CC-BY, Janšansin & Šinlo 2008 Russian-Dungan dict). These basic body-
!      part / nature words were absent and are confirmed from the Yanshansin
!      dictionary; spellings and tones taken from there. ----

LEXICON Core_t1_NNN
щигэзы:щигэзы        T1-N-NN ;   ! 膝蓋子 knee
ганзы:ганзы         T1-N-NN ;   ! 肝子 liver

LEXICON Core_t2_NNN
тэён:тэён          T2-N-NN ;   ! 太陽 sun

LEXICON Core_t3_NNN
езы:езы           T3-N-NN ;   ! 葉子 leaf
